        <h3>About Lisa</h3><br />
        <p><img src="/assets/LisaBio.png" alt="A drawing of Lisa." class="page_image" width="50%" align="center"/></p><br />
        <p>Lisa (she/they) is currently studying for an <a href="https://www.cca.edu/academics/degrees/mfa-comics/">MFA in Comics</a> at the California College of the Arts. She graduates July 2027.</p><br />
        <p>She lives on Camano Island, WA with her girlfriend <b><a href="https://absolutelyprobablynot.com">Raine</a></b> and her two corgis Brownee (5) and Gnocchi (4).  They both joined the <a href="https://camanoarts.org/" target="_blank">Camano Arts Association</a> in 2026.  You can see <a href="https://camanoarts.org/gallery/lisa-dahl/" target="_blank">Lisa's member page here!</a></p><br />
        <p>Lisa loves to read and draw about sci-fi, queer romance and memoir.  During the day, she works at a video game studio.
        Her dream is to open a Comics Library & Workshop in the Seattle area.</p><br /><br />
        <p>You can reach Lisa at <b><a href="mailto:dahllm@gmail.com">dahllm@gmail.com</a></b> or <b>Dahllm</b> on Discord and <a href="https://instagram.com/dahllm">Instagram</a>!</p><br /><br />

        <p><img src="/assets/aboutme.jpg" alt="A picture of Lisa and Banshee." class="page_image" width="50%" align="center" /></p><br />
        </div>
        </div>
